&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="backtest-recall"&gt;Backtest recall&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="backtest-recall"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#backtest-recall" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;On &lt;strong&gt;79&lt;/strong&gt; commits from this repository&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;ci&lt;/code&gt; workflow, replayed against today&amp;rsquo;s impact map in select mode:&lt;/p&gt;
