&lt;p&gt;Most commits here touch Go or &lt;code&gt;.circleci/&lt;/code&gt;, paths that many jobs read, so savings stay modest. A backtest of the demo monorepo is not informative: that project&amp;rsquo;s history was already produced under select mode. Caveats and limits: &lt;a href="https://circleci-labs.github.io/smarter-workflows/docs/benchmarks/benchmarks-backtest/"&gt;Backtest&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="performance"&gt;Performance&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="performance"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#performance" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synthetic workloads on one machine (2026-11-15). All documented targets passed:&lt;/p&gt;
