&lt;p&gt;Full tables and how to rerun: &lt;a href="https://circleci-labs.github.io/smarter-workflows/docs/benchmarks/benchmarks-perf/"&gt;Performance benchmarks&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Performance benchmarks</title><link>https://circleci-labs.github.io/smarter-workflows/docs/benchmarks/benchmarks-perf/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://circleci-labs.github.io/smarter-workflows/docs/benchmarks/benchmarks-perf/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;Snapshot of planner, config I/O and trace-script performance on one machine. Regenerate before comparing across releases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="method"&gt;Method&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="method"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#method" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Planner (&lt;code&gt;testing.B&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; — Package &lt;code&gt;internal/planner/benchgen&lt;/code&gt; builds synthetic &lt;code&gt;continue.yml&lt;/code&gt; files at 10, 100, 500 and 2000 workflow jobs in three shapes (wide fan-out, deep chain, diamond), with matrix entries and approvals every 7th / 11th job. Impact maps hold 100 or 10,000 repo-relative files per job; diffs list 1, 50 or 1000 changed paths. Benchmarks call &lt;code&gt;planner.Run&lt;/code&gt; in select mode with an in-memory repo (no git). &lt;code&gt;BenchmarkPlanLatency2000&lt;/code&gt; reports plan wall-time p95 at 2000 jobs with a 10k-file map (fan-out, 50-file diff).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Config (&lt;code&gt;testing.B&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;code&gt;BenchmarkConfigParse&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;BenchmarkConfigEmit&lt;/code&gt; on the same generated YAML.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trace scripts&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;code&gt;scripts/bench/trace-bench.sh&lt;/code&gt; builds temporary git repos with 1k, 10k and 100k tracked empty files under &lt;code&gt;f/&lt;/code&gt;, runs &lt;code&gt;reset-atime.sh&lt;/code&gt; then &lt;code&gt;collect-trace.sh&lt;/code&gt;, and records wall seconds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driver&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;code&gt;sh scripts/bench/perf.sh&lt;/code&gt; runs all of the above and prints Markdown tables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="targets-2026-11-15"&gt;Targets (2026-11-15)&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="targets-2026-11-15"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#targets-2026-11-15" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Target&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Result&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Plan p95 &amp;lt; 2 s at 2000 jobs and 10k-file maps&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;0.166 s&lt;/strong&gt; p95 (&lt;code&gt;BenchmarkPlanLatency2000&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;collect-trace&lt;/code&gt; &amp;lt; 10 s at 100k tracked files&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;0.355 s&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;v2 map &amp;lt; 20 MiB and decode &amp;lt; 0.5 s at 2000 jobs × 10k files&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;233 KiB&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;0.25 s&lt;/strong&gt; decode (&lt;code&gt;TestBenchMapV2FitsTarget&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All targets passed on this run. Largest single-op planner cases (2000 jobs, 10k-file map) are ~0.27–0.50 s per plan in &lt;code&gt;BenchmarkPlan/&lt;/code&gt; (see full table from &lt;code&gt;perf.sh&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="impact-map-decode-2000-jobs--10k-files-each"&gt;Impact map decode (2000 jobs × 10k files each)&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="impact-map-decode-2000-jobs--10k-files-each"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#impact-map-decode-2000-jobs--10k-files-each" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each job reads 10k paths from a shared pool of 10k repo-relative paths (worst case for v1 path repetition).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Format&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: right"&gt;On disk&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: right"&gt;Decode (median of 3)&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;v1 JSON&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;940 MiB&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;6.31 s (&lt;code&gt;BenchmarkImpactMapParse&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;BenchmarkMapV1Parse2000x10k&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;v2 gzip&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;233 KiB&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;0.25 s (&lt;code&gt;BenchmarkMapV2Parse2000x10k&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;v1 maps remain capped at &lt;strong&gt;16 MiB&lt;/strong&gt; on disk (hardening); larger or malformed maps mean a full run. v2 uses separate compressed, decompressed, table and per-job index caps (ADR 7).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reproduce map decode:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go &lt;span class="nb"&gt;test&lt;/span&gt; ./internal/impactmap -bench&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;BenchmarkMapV1Parse|BenchmarkMapV2Parse&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; -benchtime&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;3x -count&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="m"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;
